8ieIieujrk0ZBK-eZ4tcLE1lDLth9hQ6qV4vGmA6_6BA&oe=6A2C2244"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "467916352871409", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003282_467916356204742_1871921057092171900_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5KzEtlYn7eUQ7kNvwFTn8Bo&_nc_oc=Adp-wVoVFg8X0Jh-_SyvoR7n8GjMPVBscr277DBvtsEKl6tFIl6wbojFCD3TD5zPMjA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9CgXJwE_Yf_dMO6YQZ584nYTFjYm9L40tTCFOU3Y3yzA&oe=6A2C06E2"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1934382610375855", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974473_1934382613709188_7156337812617042679_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DG2Xt89Dq4cQ7kNvwGIp0RA&_nc_oc=Adp3cb4POs7KeuHrUtbscyj6IQkQu61n7vI9zVf36vLrmxkY7UdY9O7WkzokeqLkqEs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9p6RWhL_aITp18ZmeNF4rpVmdVXrfzCJOYHKba8NcCiA&oe=6A2C2933"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1524760081483769", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974531_1524760084817102_6497712644828891067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zj1GAZR9UHUQ7kNvwFcjnyc&_nc_oc=Adp41H0CDhBLcTTL_Z-IlRBbGt36Cs0lrd3oHhR8IOArxePqNSriZS7zD-eJZvGTRRE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-3Vp6U2xG_cKpU7__iOBBikjd8arSsgXE9755J0ngqyg&oe=6A2C282F"}, "display_name": "Mystery Box VR: Hidden Secrets", "keywords": [], "long_description": " AN IMMERSIVE VR PUZZLE EXPERIENCE\nInteract with objects, handles, buttons, and wheels on each side. Crack enigmas and collect hidden puzzle tiles on a random side of the boxes.\n\nYou won't be able to compare reality with fiction.\n\n# DISCOVER INVENTIONS\nOnce you unlock all 8 boxes of a Level Pack, you can compose a puzzle and discover a brief history of an invention.\n\nIt's not always easy to escape the room, so use all your IQ to crack the riddles. There's a logic behind all of them, even where it seems it's not!\n\n# IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK\nPlay the game with your headphones to get immersed in this amazing adventure.\n\n# HINTS\nGot stuck on some enigma? No worries, you can still get a helpful hint! You can also get in touch with me in case you really can't make it through a riddle, I'll be glad to help ;)\n\n# MULTILANGUAGE\nAvailable in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese.\n\nThe game language will change automatically based on the language settings of your device", "short_description": "A VR escape room game where you have to solve intriguing riddles to open boxes and discover nice stories about popular inventions!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "$R36BSY5.png", "id": "3678762505771822", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031430_3678762509105155_2151975047074617165_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7y7GWKmahVoQ7kNvwHKKQ3E&_nc_oc=Adr2p8DjlGseoJXFdeWnZ9D-UOOypYvLFS1mkvXbo4mnhBxryxDRrrMqUYvPTaaEv7I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9udfER4swRxqjkOVTF4mBMp2Ej86zdxO8pXROmCkF7LQ&oe=6A2C2425"}, {"file_name": "$R81V725.png", "id": "2720695481426567", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262743_2720695484759900_604086922326600035_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yjV5r7i7aWAQ7kNvwH876gU&_nc_oc=AdpKeboSsC41dVxKyvVCci_OOEWo2hKx_HzQMODByBVEb-IHZtg863-JSFdwBInC2SU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-jIUXp9RGx5I1j3MyYJESuYn2rFfORbJ1cPkZAwfBcnw&oe=6A2C230D"}, {"file_name": "$RQ3SN6U.png", "id": "1552311425628973", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982519_1552311428962306_1218130395049083834_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VIcirpHbD9wQ7kNvwG5V-UA&_nc_oc=Adq-4qiot5gNsIOcibVWTnIjXPynssKrFd3lLmHtuu-_AZMu7cSUXlwbQL2zSlOypUQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=